    {
      "id": "u_f96a0c798502da6588eb8c9f_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The following are alternatives to Trilium's built-in MCP feature. Since Trilium's AI implementation is still experimental, its tooling might not be as mature as external tools.",
